        "created_at": "2016-10-05T11:57:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>(Note to self: games below this note have been added to Sentinels Statistics Project, games above this note still need to be added)</p>\n<p>Advanced Infinitor defeated at Pike Industrial Complex on the 4th attempt.</p>\n<p>NightMist in Mist-form is an automatic win in this scenario… A plus 1 damage boost and 5 users of Expatriette’s 1 projectle damage incap ability on NightMist managed to save a lot of time though.  Interestingly, Mist-form was the only card NightMist played all game thanks to Crushing Cages.</p>",
