        "created_at": "2016-10-10T20:31:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>First battle of Dark Watch vs. Wager Master at Omnitron IV was a loss via The New Deal... I think that's the first time I've lost to that card's effect).</p><p>Second battle I managed a very close win with NightMist incapacitated on the villain turn after \"Playing Dice With The Cosmos\" had checked for the loss condition. I managed to use Tire Iron to work around \"Who Are You Fighting?\" that round before&nbsp;<span>\"Playing Dice With The Cosmos\" could trigger me to lose on the following Villain turn.</span></p>",
