        "created_at": "2016-10-12T00:31:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Cosmic Omnitron was on 60 HP when he took out Mr. Fixer, Setback, and Expat. He was down to 8 HP when he took out NightMist with Technological Singularity. All this was at Tomb of Anubis.</p><p>Game 2 took a nasty turn as well with Omnitron playing most of his deck in 1 turn thanks to Terraforming. Another loss.</p><p>Game 3 a really bad loss; this time Setback was the last hero to fall.</p><p>Game 4 was the charm with NightMist as the last hero standing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
