        "created_at": "2016-10-16T17:45:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm surprised Freedom Five did that much better than the Prime Wardens. &nbsp; I suspected DW would be at a disadvantage only because it's four heroes verses the five that the other two have but I didn't think they'd suffer that much especially Spite Agent of Gloom. &nbsp; &nbsp;The Dreamer, Progeny, Kaargra Warfang, and Cosmic Omnitron were the only ones that all teams had to face multiple times. &nbsp; I am surprised there weren't more losses across the teams with the Rook City villains.&nbsp;</p>",
